### Send OTP (SMS) to a phone number
# In development the code is logged by the server and stored in Redis under
# `otp:dev:<sessionId>` — read it there to complete signup/login.
# @name sendOtp
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "201994916",
  "provider": "sms"
}

### Grab the sessionId from the response above:
# {{sendOtp.response.body.data.sessionId}}
